# =============================================================================
# EXPERIMENT 73
# EXACT A/B CHANNEL RECURRENCE DISCOVERY
#
# Goal:
#
#   We know that
#
#       L_d(N,X) = X^d h_d(N/X)
#
#   and
#
#       h_d(t) = A_d(u) + (2t+1) B_d(u),
#       u = t(t+1).
#
# The present experiment asks:
#
#   Are the A_d and B_d sequences generated by short exact recurrences
#   with low-degree polynomial coefficients in u?
#
# No floating point.
# No regression.
# No numerical fitting.
# No interpolation.
# All identities are checked exactly.
# =============================================================================


